    "description_meta": "Yubo Wang (王钰博) — Ph.D. student in Computer Science at the University of Waterloo (TIGER-Lab, Vector Institute). Research on LLM post-training and reasoning, evaluation benchmarks (MMLU-Pro), and coding-agent foundation models."
